 ent during the game against Wagner on Saturday\, Sept. 19. The game\, whic
 h will take place during “Rooted in the Bay Day\,” a day that celebrat
 es Bay Area community and culture\, is scheduled for 12:30 p.m. “Whether
  you’re singing along to ‘Save Me San Francisco’ or cheering for a t
 ouchdown\, you won’t wanna miss a single thing we do\,” university off
